; table offset &91. For *HELP with an argument, handles '.' as a shortcut to list all NFS
; commands, otherwise iterates through help topics using PHA/PHA/RTS dispatch to print
; matching command groups. Returns with Y = ws_page (unclaimed).
;
; On Entry:
;     A: 9 (service call number)
;     Y: command-line offset of *HELP argument
