; ***************************************************************************************
; Search receive code table for match
;
; Scans a table of receive operation codes starting at index X, comparing each against A.
; Returns with Z set if a match is found, Z clear if the end-of-table marker is reached.
;
; On Entry:
;     A: receive code to match
;     X: starting table index
;
; On Exit:
;     Z: set if match found
; &adda referenced 3 times by &ad90, &ad99, &ade0
.match_rx_code
